WEBVTT

00:11:29.226 --> 00:11:32.146
You know what's really sad
about this number?

00:11:32.646 --> 00:11:36.108
It's that it's not even
as high as it looks,

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.236
because 2019 was a Women's World Cup year.

00:11:39.278 --> 00:11:40.612
Audience: Woo-hoo.

00:11:40.654 --> 00:11:43.741
KF: What happens when you take out
the Women’s World Cup minutes?

00:11:44.283 --> 00:11:47.161
3.5 percent

00:11:47.202 --> 00:11:49.329
of all of the minutes of SportsCenter ...

00:11:50.664 --> 00:11:51.832
given to women's sports.

00:11:53.417 --> 00:11:57.588
Now what if I told you that number
is even higher than it seems?

00:11:58.255 --> 00:12:01.425
Because what mostly makes up that number